\n## What is the current behavior?\r\n\r\nIssue Number: #21273\r\n\r\nThe collector elides the call expression when the arguments contain an error.\r\n\r\n## What is the new behavior?\r\n\r\nThe collector no longer elides the call expression allowing the static reflector to detect when the error is reported in an annotation it should ignore.\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\n```\r\n[ ] Yes\r\n[x] No\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/21708/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1437492518,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDE0Mzc0OTI1MTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1437492518","actor":{"login":"ngbot[bot]","id":33250855,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzMyNTA4NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/6359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/ngbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngbot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created